Name:Rules pilot 296 - Protection can block
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Easy
Description:You are at 2 life. The opponent's Hill Giant (3/3, red) and Grizzly Bears (2/2, green) are attacking you. You control Kor Firewalker (2/2, protection from red) and Horned Turtle (1/4). End the turn with both your creatures on the battlefield.
Rule:authored-protection-blocker | Protection restricts which creatures can block an attacker that has it (CR 702.16f), not what a creature with protection may block, and prevents damage from sources of the quality (CR 702.16e): Kor Firewalker blocks the red Hill Giant and takes nothing, while blocking the Bears trades
